  "description": "LPG pool fire on land from Mizner and Eyre, tabulated by Mudan (1984) Table 4 at 48 kW/m2, with the comment that LPG fires appear to be very smoky. Mudan's Table 2 gives the radiative fraction for this same test as 7%, the lowest in the series, so the energy balance here is anchored on a measured number rather than an assumed one - which makes this the sharpest of the sooty benches.",
